{"data":{"updated_timestamp":"29/10/2026 22:01:50","profile":{"player_id":"94784","last_updated":"29/10/2026 22:01","fullname":"Kiribathgala Kankanamalage Eshan Malinga Dharmasena","short_display_name":"E Malinga","name":"Eshan Malinga","gender":"M","dob":"04/02/2001","date_of_death":null,"place_birth":"Sri Lanka","nationality_id":"8","nationality":"Sri Lanka","nationality_short_code":"SL","nick_name":null,"player_skill":{"id":"2","text":"Bowler","role":"Bowler"},"batting_style":{"id":"2","text":"Left Handed"},"bowling_style":{"id":"10","text":"Right-arm fast medium"},"writeup":"<p>Eshan Malinga, a promising young fast bowler from Sri Lanka, has been making waves in the cricketing world with his right-arm fast-medium deliveries. Born in Sri Lanka, Malinga has quickly established himself as a key player for his national team, showcasing his talent in various formats. His ODI debut against New Zealand in January 2025 marked the beginning of what promises to be a remarkable international career. In his short stint, Malinga has already taken four wickets in five ODIs, with a best bowling figure of 3-35 against New Zealand, demonstrating his potential to become a leading wicket-taker for Sri Lanka.</p>\r\n<br />\r\n<p>Malinga's bowling style is characterized by his ability to generate pace and movement, making him a formidable opponent for batters. His recent performances in the ODI series against Australia and New Zealand have highlighted his knack for picking up crucial wickets, even in challenging conditions.</p>\r\n<br />\r\n<p>In the domestic circuit, Malinga has been a consistent performer for Ragama Cricket Club and Sri Lanka A. His first-class record includes picking up over 40 wickets in his first 20 games, including a five-wicket haul. His ability to adapt to different pitch conditions and maintain a steady line and length has been instrumental in his success.</p>\r\n<br />\r\n<p>Malinga's journey in franchise cricket has seen him play for teams like Sunrisers Hyderabad and Jaffna Kings, where he continues to hone his skills against international players. His participation in the SA20 League with Paarl Royals has provided him with valuable exposure to different playing styles and conditions, further enhancing his growth as a cricketer.</p>\r\n<br />\r\n<p>Malinga carried the momentum of his ODI debut into the IPL the same year, picking up 13 wickets in just 7 matches and emerging as one of the team&rsquo;s most reliable death bowlers. His performances across leagues further highlighted his growing reputation. Later in the year, he added another milestone by making his T20I debut against Zimbabwe and was also included in the Sri Lankan squad for the 2026 T20 World Cup. Impressed by his consistency and impact across formats, Sunrisers Hyderabad showed strong faith in his potential by retaining him for the 2026 IPL season.</p>\r\n<br />\r\n<p>Eshan Malinga's rise in the cricketing world is a testament to his hard work and dedication. As he continues to develop his skills and gain experience, the cricketing fraternity eagerly anticipates his contributions to Sri Lankan cricket in the years to come.</p>\r\n<br />","relation":null,"social_details":{"social_platform":[{"social_platform_id":"1","social_platform_name":"facebook","social_platform_url":"https://www.facebook.com/eshan.malinga.96/"},{"social_platform_id":"2","social_platform_name":"twitter","social_platform_url":""},{"social_platform_id":"3","social_platform_name":"instagram","social_platform_url":"https://www.instagram.com/malinga__96/"},{"social_platform_id":"4","social_platform_name":"youtube","social_platform_url":""},{"social_platform_id":"5","social_platform_name":"pinterest","social_platform_url":""},{"social_platform_id":"6","social_platform_name":"linkedin","social_platform_url":""},{"social_platform_id":"7","social_platform_name":"josh","social_platform_url":""},{"social_platform_id":"8","social_platform_name":"moj","social_platform_url":""},{"social_platfor